# Paystack configuration

Add these values to your environment before testing the checkout flow.

```bash
PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_xxxxx
NEXT_PUBLIC_PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY=pk_test_xxxxx
PAYMENT_MODE=test
PAYMENT_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-random-webhook-secret
```

Then configure the Paystack dashboard webhook URL to:

```text
https://your-domain.com/api/payments/webhook
```

Enabled webhook events:
- charge.success
- charge.failed

The app creates a booking first, then initializes a Paystack transaction and redirects the customer to the returned authorization URL.
